Alkahest Freight is a logistics company that specializes in cross-horizon shipping. Many a far-horizon colony has been founded using supplies brought by Alkahest.

The company operates on [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]]'s train lines and ships bulk goods both across [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]] and between horizons. In the weeks before the pilgrimage's end it began spending capital in ways that did not fit its usual business, with a spike over recent weeks, and [[Org/Belvedere|Belvedere]] passed the name to [[People/Benny|Benny]] as one of two companies worth investigating.
